<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span id="xdx_F07_zdNJ3fIImHAa" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(a)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F12_zBumauBRe0Y9" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001463" xml:lang="en-US">On
    November 10, 2023, UTime SZ entered into a working capital loan agreement with China Resources Bank of Zhuhai Co., Ltd., to borrow
    RMB<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20231110__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesBankOfZhuhaiCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember_zWwaUPtXi0d4" title="Borrowing amount" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2023-11-10_custom_ChinaResourcesBankOfZhuhaiCoLtdMember_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001465" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">22</ix:nonFraction></span>
    million as working capital at an annual effective interest rate of <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20231110__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesBankOfZhuhaiCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember_zxDDlr6xSrn" title="Effective interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2023-11-10_custom_ChinaResourcesBankOfZhuhaiCoLtdMember_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001467" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.55</ix:nonFraction></span>%.
    The loan was rollover in November 2024 and November 2025<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">.</span> The loan will be due in November 202<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">6</span> with interest rate of&#160;<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20261130__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember__srt--StatementScenarioAxis__srt--ScenarioForecastMember_zRJ7hSFcwzSl" title="Effective interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2026-11-30_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember_srt_ScenarioForecastMember" id="Fact001469" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.0</ix:nonFraction>%</span>.
    The Company mortgaged the office owned by UTime SZ.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>

<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td>
