    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_F0E_zpKLC24h55Z5" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(b)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F18_zbNTXCCxzlg2" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001470" xml:lang="en-US">On
    December 11, 2023, UTime SZ entered into a loan agreement with ICBC, to borrow RMB<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20231211__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--IndustrialAndCommercialBankOfChinaICBCLoanMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember_zaQ3zLRJbKo1" title="Borrowing amount" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-11_custom_IndustrialAndCommercialBankOfChinaICBCLoanMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001472" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">8</ix:nonFraction></span>
    million as working capital at an annual effective interest rate of <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20231211__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--IndustrialAndCommercialBankOfChinaICBCLoanMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember_zPD0wvyOuUak" title="Effective interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-11_custom_IndustrialAndCommercialBankOfChinaICBCLoanMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001474" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.85</ix:nonFraction></span>%.
    The loan was renewed in December 2024 and December 2025<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">.</span> The loan will be due in November 202<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">6</span> with interest rate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20261130__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__srt--StatementScenarioAxis__srt--ScenarioForecastMember_z4hyeMMEpHKa" title="Effective interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2026-11-30_custom_LoanAgreementMember_srt_ScenarioForecastMember" id="Fact001476" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.2</ix:nonFraction></span>%.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>

<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td>
