<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_F05_zdYXid19Pe66" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(c)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F06_zucPwbYuDvbb" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
     January 2, 2024, UTime SZ entered into a credit agreement with Bank of Beijing, according to which Bank of Beijing agreed to provide
    UTime SZ with a credit facility of up to RMB<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--LineOfCredit_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20240102__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BankOfBeijingMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CreditAgreementMember_z17ZkcnHI9Bh" title="Credit facility" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCredit" contextRef="AsOf2024-01-02_custom_BankOfBeijingMember_custom_CreditAgreementMember" id="Fact001478" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">10</ix:nonFraction></span> million with a three-year term from January 2, 2024 to January 2, 2027. On January
    2, 2024, UTime SZ entered into a loan agreement with Bank of Beijing, to borrow RMB<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20240102__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BankOfBeijingMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember_zsHCmJRmvRbj" title="Borrowing amount" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-01-02_custom_BankOfBeijingMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001480" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">5</ix:nonFraction></span> million as working capital at an annual effective
    interest rate of <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20240102__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BankOfBeijingMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember_zBrVQnnuhlJa" title="Effective interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-01-02_custom_BankOfBeijingMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001482" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.05</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The loan is guaranteed by Mr. Bao and his spouse and will be due in January 2027.</span></td></tr>

