    The loan is guaranteed by Mr. Bao and his spouse, Mrs. He Bo, the legal representative of UTime Guangxi, UTime SZ and Nanning
    Nanfang Financing Guarantee Co., Ltd, a third party. The loan was rolled over in January 2025 and, as a result, the loan will be due in January 2027
    with interest rate of <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20270131__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--GuangxiBeibuGulfBankMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember__srt--StatementScenarioAxis__srt--ScenarioForecastMember_zoEYfT459pU3" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2027-01-31_custom_GuangxiBeibuGulfBankMember_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember_srt_ScenarioForecastMember" id="Fact001506" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.5</ix:nonFraction></span>%.</ix:footnote> </span></td></tr>

