    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1E_zS2g5Qi8suKd" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001507" xml:lang="en-US">On
    May 8, 2025, UTime SZ entered into a working capital loan agreement with Shanghai Pudong Development Bank to borrow RMB<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20250508__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ShanghaiPudongDevelopmentBankMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember_zASgdejJk9Z5" title="Borrowing amount" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-05-08_custom_ShanghaiPudongDevelopmentBankMember_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001509" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">8</ix:nonFraction></span> million
    as working capital at an annual effective interest rate of <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250508__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ShanghaiPudongDevelopmentBankMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember_z75tbcyfU9E5" title="Effective interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-05-08_custom_ShanghaiPudongDevelopmentBankMember_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001511" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.32</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The loan will be due in April 2026.</ix:footnote> </span></td></tr>
