    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1D_zLwzPhxGFKm9" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001512" xml:lang="en-US">In
    February 2025, UTime SZ entered into a credit agreement with Postal Savings Bank of China Bank to borrow RMB<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20250228__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PostalSavingsBankOfChinaBankMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CreditAgreementMember_zT9SrmsK9c15" title="Borrowing amount" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-02-28_custom_PostalSavingsBankOfChinaBankMember_custom_CreditAgreementMember" id="Fact001514" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">5</ix:nonFraction></span>
