    years</ix:nonNumeric></span> with interest rate of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250228__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PostalSavingsBankOfChinaBankMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CreditAgreementMember_zPYX6LgYRP0a" title="Effective interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEJPUlJPV0lOR1MgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FscykA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-02-28_custom_PostalSavingsBankOfChinaBankMember_custom_CreditAgreementMember" id="Fact001518" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.66</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The loan was originally due in February 2026 and was renewed for another year such that it will be due in February 2027. Mr. Bao is a co-borrower for this
    loan.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
