<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of March 31, 2025, other payables mainly included RMB<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--OtherPayables_iI_pn5n6_c20250331_zIFOhxRbEUhf" title="Other payables"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:OtherPayables" contextRef="AsOf2025-03-31" id="Fact001539" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">12.1</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;million
