<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(1)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
    April 1, 2023, the Company entered into a loan agreement with Grandsky Phoenix Limited to borrow USD <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_pn5n6_uUSD_c20230401__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--GrandskyPhoenixLimitedMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember_zfAF1inJknBi" title="Short-term borrowings" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyBUUkFOU0FDVElPTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2023-04-01_custom_GrandskyPhoenixLimitedMember_custom_LoanAgreementMember" id="Fact001603" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million, with a term of
    <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentTerm_dc_c20230401__20230401__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--GrandskyPhoenixLimitedMember_zX3f3i34t2We" title="Borrowing term" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyBUUkFOU0FDVElPTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-04-012023-04-01_custom_GrandskyPhoenixLimitedMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="Fact001605" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm">one year</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The loan is interest free. On April 1, 2024, the Company entered into a supplementary agreement with Grandsky Phoenix Limited,
    who agreed to extend the term for additional one year. As of December 31, 2025, the company repaid USD <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--LoansPayable_iI_uUSD_c20251231_zE8ZzATTXr17" title="Repaid amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LoansPayable" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact001607" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,033,800</ix:nonFraction></span>, and the remaining loan balance was extended for one year.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Starting
    from July 2024, the Company has successively obtained the interest-free loans from Director Wu totaling RMB <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--InterestFreeLoansAmount_pn5n6_uRMB_c20240731__20240731__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--DirectorMember_zsMGOHLLO749" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyBUUkFOU0FDVElPTlMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJhbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:InterestFreeLoansAmount" contextRef="From2024-07-312024-07-31_srt_DirectorMember" id="Fact001608" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">1.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
    million.</span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AD_zKBNocvmhxod" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-04-01to2025-09-30" escape="true" id="Fact001610" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80D_eus-gaap--StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock_z5Wq3VpDZIK3" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
14 &#8212; <span id="xdx_827_zOk7pLWNqP26">SHAREHOLDERS&#8217; EQUITY</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
April 8, 2021, the Company completed its IPO and listed on the Nasdaq Capital Market. In the offering, <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_c20210408__20210408__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--GrandskyPhoenixLimitedMember_zmtuM8k0BoYh" title="Issuance of ordinary shares (in Shares)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2021-04-082021-04-08_custom_GrandskyPhoenixLimitedMember" id="Fact001612" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,750,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
of the Company&#8217;s ordinary shares were issued and sold to the public at a price of US$<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--PublicPricePerShare_uUSDPShares_c20210408__20210408_zDRs8PgLF7Ff" title="Public price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:PublicPricePerShare" contextRef="From2021-04-082021-04-08" id="Fact001614" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">4</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share for gross proceeds of US$<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromIssuanceInitialPublicOffering_pn6n6_uUSD_c20210408__20210408__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember_zx7rv5kGAPC" title="Gross proceeds"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceInitialPublicOffering" contextRef="From2021-04-082021-04-08_us-gaap_CommonStockMember" id="Fact001616" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">15</ix:nonFraction></span>
million. The Company recorded net proceeds (after deducting underwriting discounts and commissions and other offering fees and
expenses) of approximately $<span id="xdx_902_ecustom--OfferingFeesAndExpenses_pn5n6_uUSD_c20210408__20210408_zRN6PKz1n9Li" title="Gross proceeds"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:OfferingFeesAndExpenses" contextRef="From2021-04-082021-04-08" id="Fact001618" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">13.9</ix:nonFraction></span>
million (approximately RMB<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--OfferingFeesAndExpenses_pn5n6_c20210408__20210408_zSniVdoiIyN1" title="Offering fees and expenses"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:OfferingFeesAndExpenses" contextRef="From2021-04-082021-04-08" id="Fact001620" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">88.2</ix:nonFraction></span>
million) from the offering.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
June 29, 2022, the board of directors of the Company approved the 2022 Performance Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2022 PIP&#8221;).
Under the 2022 PIP, the Company reserved a total of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance_iI_c20220629_zlnkJA8vxBl7" title="Common stock for issuance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" contextRef="AsOf2022-06-29" id="Fact001622" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">5,300,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
ordinary shares for issuance as or under awards to be made to the participants of the Company. On November 7, 2022, <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20221107__20221107_zSm3RCjIPI17" title="Common stock issued and granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2022-11-072022-11-07" id="Fact001624" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">5,300,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
ordinary shares were issued and granted under the 2022 PIP. The fair value of the ordinary shares  granted was
calculated at $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--StockGrantedDuringPeriodValueSharebasedCompensation_uUSD_c20221107__20221107_zrUANIFV1Ah9" title="Common stock granted fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockGrantedDuringPeriodValueSharebasedCompensation" contextRef="From2022-11-072022-11-07" id="Fact001626" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">9,301,500</ix:nonFraction></span>
as of the date of issuance at $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_uUSDPShares_c20221107_zGsmyfM74VCc" title="Price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2022-11-07" id="Fact001628" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">1.755</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
November 15, 2023, an aggregate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20231115__20231115__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoPerformanceIncentivePlanMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember_zpd3Wt5978Pj" title="Common stock issued and granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2023-11-152023-11-15_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoPerformanceIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember" id="Fact001630" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">4,700,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
ordinary shares were granted and issued under the 2022 PIP. Total fair value of the ordinary shares granted
was calculated at $<span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--CommonStockGranted_uUSD_c20231115__20231115__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoPerformanceIncentivePlanMember_z2LGVryq8whc" title="Common stock granted"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:CommonStockGranted" contextRef="From2023-11-152023-11-15_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoPerformanceIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001632" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,179,700</ix:nonFraction></span>
as of the date of issuance at $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_uUSDPShares_c20231115__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoPerformanceIncentivePlanMember_z1LmI2NjRc8i" title="Price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2023-11-15_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoPerformanceIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001634" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.251</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share. To date, no new shares have been allocated to the 2022 PIP and no separate performance incentive plan has been adopted.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160; </span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
November 15, 2023, the Company entered into certain securities purchase agreement (the &#8220;November 2023 SPA&#8221;) with certain
&#8220;non-U.S. Persons&#8221; (the &#8220;November 2023 Purchasers&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company agreed to sell to the
November 2023 Purchasers an aggregate of <span id="xdx_909_ecustom--SaleOfMaximumNumberOfUnits_c20231115__20231115__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_z9G5xXcmN6Z3" title="Aggregate sale of units"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:SaleOfMaximumNumberOfUnits" contextRef="From2023-11-152023-11-15_custom_NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001636" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">373,846,160</ix:nonFraction></span>
units (the &#8220;November 2023 Units&#8221;), each November 2023 Unit consisting of <span id="xdx_901_ecustom--NumberOfShare_dc_c20231115__20231115__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_zZjkfg7v79o5" title="Ordinary share"><ix:nonFraction name="WTO:NumberOfShare" contextRef="From2023-11-152023-11-15_custom_NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001638" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">one</ix:nonFraction></span>
ordinary share of the Company, par value $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare_iI_uUSDPShares_c20231115__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_z1kHZnscuOXj" title="Ordinary shares, par value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2023-11-15_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001640" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.0001</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share and a warrant to purchase three shares with an initial exercise price of $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20231115__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_z4IQF1rQja26" title="Initial exercise price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2023-11-15_custom_NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001642" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.33</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share, at a price of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_uUSDPShares_c20231115__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_zytMbG9tt3f2" title="Price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2023-11-15_custom_NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001644" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.13</ix:nonFraction></span>
per November 2023 Unit, for an aggregate purchase price of approximately $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants_pn5n6_uUSD_c20231115__20231115__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_z2wj51ojQ9U4" title="Aggregate purchase price of warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" contextRef="From2023-11-152023-11-15_custom_NovemberTwoThousandAndTwentyThreeSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001646" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">48.6</ix:nonFraction></span>
million. On March 18, 2024, the transaction contemplated by the November 2023 SPA consummated when all the closing conditions of the
November 2023 SPA have been satisfied and the Company issued the November 2023 Units to the November 2023 Purchasers pursuant to the
November 2023 SPA.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

